H("889.d.19.H",3,"A mechanic reads the steps for removing a turbine engine fuel control unit and installing the new one with fresh seals. She is:","explaining procedures for removing and installing a turbine engine fuel control unit",["ignoring the FCU","painting the FCU","guessing"],"FCU swap.")
