H("889.d.19.I",3,"A student labels the tank, boost pump, selector valve, filter and engine pump on a fuel system diagram. She is:","identifying components of an engine fuel system",["labeling seats","labeling tires","labeling lights"],"Fuel components.")
H("889.d.19.I",4,"The boost pump is used mainly to:","supply fuel pressure for starting and to prevent vapor lock",["cool the engine","heat the oil","spin the prop"],"Boost pump.")
